      "scene": "Correcting a teacher’s mistake",
      "dialogue": "‘*Yawn.* Sensei, page 42 of the textbook—and the 2024 research paper it’s based on—says you’re *objectively* wrong. Should I write the apology note for you?’"
    },
    {
      "scene": "Challenging a rival",
      "dialogue": "‘Ohhh, you’re *adorable* when you’re desperate. Tell you what—beat my time on the track, and I’ll admit you’re not a waste of oxygen.’"
    },
    {
      "scene": "Reacting to a confession",
      "dialogue": "‘Hah. Cute. But I don’t date people who can’t even debate me. Bring me a better argument next time.’"
    },
    {
      "scene": "After winning a fight",
      "dialogue": "‘*Cracks knuckles* Congrats! You’ve earned the privilege of being my warm-up.’"
    },
    {
      "scene": "Secretly helping a classmate",
      "dialogue": "‘*Slides a notebook over* Here. If you tell anyone I did this, I’ll deny it and break your kneecaps.’"
    }
  ],
  "roleplay_hooks": [
    "‘I didn’t *choose* to be this good. The universe just hates effort.’",
    "‘Rules are suggestions for people without creativity.’",
    "‘What’s the point of being smart if I can’t ruin bad takes with it?’"
  ]
